class Metric_TestAccuracy:
    """
    Test set accuracy (%).
    
    Computation:
      acc = (predictions == ground_truth).float().mean() * 100
    
    Reported as:
      acc_mean ± acc_std (over 10 seeds)
    
    Why it matters:
      The main task. But on homophilous graphs (Cora/CiteSeer/PubMed),
      a 2-layer GCN with LayerNorm+residual is already near-SOTA.
      Do NOT claim oscillator success unless gain > 1.5σ.
    
    Interpretation:
      Cora/CiteSeer/PubMed: oscillators should tie within noise
      Chameleon/Squirrel:   degree-selective mechanisms (WC) might help
      Roman-empire:         long-range transport (SL) should show gains
    """
